@startuml Merge Help Agent - High Level Sequence Diagram

title Merge Help Agent - High Level Flow (Retry + Human-in-the-Loop)

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "GitHub" as GH #LightBlue
participant "Agent\nRunner" as Runner #LightGreen
participant "LLM\nAgent" as LLM #Orange
participant "MergeConflict\nTools" as MCTools #LightCoral
participant "CodeReview\nTools" as CRTools #Plum
participant "Sandbox\n(Docker)" as Sandbox #Cyan
participant "RAG\nStore" as RAG #Pink

== Webhook Reception ==

GH -> Runner : POST webhook\n(PR opened/sync/reopened)
activate Runner
Runner --> GH : 202 Accepted
Runner -> Runner : set OAuthContext
Runner -> LLM : run(session, context)
activate LLM

== Iteration 1 ==

LLM -> MCTools : fetchBranchInfo(base)
activate MCTools
MCTools -> GH : GET branches
GH --> MCTools : SHA
MCTools --> LLM : baseSHA
deactivate MCTools

LLM -> MCTools : fetchBranchInfo(head)
activate MCTools
MCTools -> GH : GET branches
GH --> MCTools : SHA
MCTools --> LLM : headSHA
deactivate MCTools

LLM -> MCTools : detectMergeConflicts(base, head)
activate MCTools
MCTools -> GH : GET compare
GH --> MCTools : conflicting files
MCTools --> LLM : conflicts list
deactivate MCTools

LLM -> MCTools : fetchFileContent(base + head)
activate MCTools
MCTools -> GH : GET contents
GH --> MCTools : file content
MCTools --> LLM : base & head file content
deactivate MCTools

LLM -> CRTools : searchConflictPatterns(description)
activate CRTools
CRTools -> RAG : findSimilarPatterns(query)
activate RAG
RAG -> RAG : embed + cosine similarity
RAG --> CRTools : results
deactivate RAG

alt RAG patterns found
    CRTools --> LLM : past resolution patterns\n(use as guidance)
else No patterns found
    CRTools --> LLM : "No similar patterns found.\nProceed with independent analysis."
end
deactivate CRTools

LLM -> LLM : Analyze conflict\n+ generate resolution\n(LLM reasoning with or without RAG guidance)

== Sandbox Validation ==

LLM -> CRTools : validateCodeInSandbox(resolvedCode)
activate CRTools
CRTools -> Sandbox : validate(content, language)
activate Sandbox
Sandbox -> Sandbox : compile / lint
Sandbox --> CRTools : FAIL (errors)
deactivate Sandbox
CRTools --> LLM : validation failed + error output
deactivate CRTools

== Retry (fix + re-validate) ==

LLM -> LLM : Read error output\nFix resolved code

LLM -> CRTools : validateCodeInSandbox(fixedCode)
activate CRTools
CRTools -> Sandbox : validate(fixedContent, language)
activate Sandbox
Sandbox -> Sandbox : compile / lint
Sandbox --> CRTools : PASS
deactivate Sandbox
CRTools --> LLM : validation passed
deactivate CRTools

== Commit Resolution ==

LLM -> MCTools : createResolutionBranch(baseSHA)
activate MCTools
MCTools -> GH : POST git/refs
GH --> MCTools : branch created
MCTools --> LLM : success
deactivate MCTools

LLM -> MCTools : commitResolvedFile(branch, path, content)
activate MCTools
MCTools -> GH : PUT contents/{path}
GH --> MCTools : committed
MCTools --> LLM : commit SHA
deactivate MCTools

== Store Pattern + Comment ==

LLM -> CRTools : storeConflictPattern(resolution)
activate CRTools
CRTools -> RAG : store(pattern)
activate RAG
RAG -> RAG : embed + persist
RAG --> CRTools : stored
deactivate RAG
CRTools --> LLM : pattern saved
deactivate CRTools

LLM -> MCTools : commentOnPullRequest(analysis)
activate MCTools
MCTools -> GH : POST issue comment
GH --> MCTools : comment created
MCTools --> LLM : posted
deactivate MCTools

LLM -> MCTools : exitLoop()
activate MCTools
MCTools --> LLM : done
deactivate MCTools

deactivate LLM
Runner -> Runner : OAuthContext.clear()
deactivate Runner

== Failure Path: Human-in-the-Loop ==

note over Runner, RAG #FFCCCC
  If resolution fails after 2 iterations,
  the agent escalates to a human reviewer
end note

GH -> Runner : (iteration 2 also failed)
activate Runner
Runner -> LLM : escalate
activate LLM

LLM -> CRTools : generateHumanReviewReport(\nconflicts, attempts, sandboxResults)
activate CRTools
CRTools -> CRTools : Build review.md:\n- Conflict summary\n- Attempt history (2 iterations)\n- Sandbox error outputs\n- Manual resolution suggestions
CRTools --> LLM : review report (Markdown)
deactivate CRTools

LLM -> MCTools : commentOnPullRequest(escalation report)
activate MCTools
MCTools -> GH : POST issue comment\n(detailed escalation)
GH --> MCTools : comment created
MCTools --> LLM : escalation posted
deactivate MCTools

LLM -> MCTools : exitLoop()
activate MCTools
MCTools --> LLM : done
deactivate MCTools

deactivate LLM
Runner -> Runner : OAuthContext.clear()
deactivate Runner

note over GH #LIGHTYELLOW
  Human reviewer picks up from the
  escalation comment with full diagnostic info
end note

@enduml